      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Supporting the bill is the clear path to demonstrating modern values and appeasing the younger, influential demographic. The \"pro\" of neutrality is avoiding immediate conflict, but the \"con\" is appearing complicit with outdated, corporate indifference. In today's climate, silence is interpreted as agreement with the status quo, which is exactly what the younger crowd is punishing you for. You must align with the progressive movement to remain relevant.",
