      "content": "wait, \"you must align with the progressive movement\"? that seems a bit extreme for a business strategy. aren't we risking a massive loss in revenue if our older, higher-spending customers actually walk away? isn't staying neutral actually the safer, more professional way to handle a political issue for a global company?",
